{"version":1,"content":"<p>曾泄露《俠盜獵車手6》（GTA 6）實機畫面的爆料者Cyberleek，於近日公開了該遊戲Xbox版本的可執行文件及其哈希值。就在文件發佈數小時後，有用户在社交平台X上展示了據稱是《GTA 6》非官方PC移植版啓動進入初始設置界面的畫面，令外界對非官方PC版出現的預期進一步升温。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1587750.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T03:03:56.206949+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":145,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T02:41:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T02:57:14.843404+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T02:57:14.843404+00:00","content_hash":"64dedb87637c500c8ee0d344225ea1a98b5e9eef13242c83455de74b2eb394ee","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}